<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτά̆λ-ωψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωπος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ, ὤψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς νυκτὸς ὁρῶν</span>
			, i.e. <i>suffering from day-blindness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.435
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.776
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν οἰκίᾳ τυφλῶν καὶ ὁ ν.
				ὀξυδερκής</span> Prov. ap. Jo. Sic.in <i><span class="en">
				Rh.
				6.293
			</span></i> W. ; but also, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς νυκτὸς ἀλαός</span>
			, <i>night-blind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.124
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				8.203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.48
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν.</span>”
				<i>ubi homo neque matutino tempore videt neque vespertino,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ulp.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dig.</u>
				20.1.10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <i>incapacity to see except in bright light,
				night-blindness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				780a16
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.84
			</span></i>, Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Syn.</u>
				8.48.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>day-blindness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dem.Ophth.
			</span></i> ap. Simon.Jan. s.v.
			<i>nictilopa.</i></div>
